# Root Monorepo Git Ignore Rules

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/

# Build & Compilation Outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.swp
*.bak

# Python Bytecode & Caches
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Environment Variables & Secrets (Keep .env.example tracked)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# Logs & Debugging
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Operating System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Heavy Media & Screen Recordings
*.mp4

# Test audio recordings & temporary captures
**/public/recordings/*.wav
!**/public/recordings/.gitkeep

# Agent metadata
.agents/
